# U2 unit: the copy-text screen v3 re-check (maintainer, 2026-10-14)

The campaign's screen standard became v3 (audits/evidence/retrofit/copy-text-screen-v3.py, SHA-256
f4feac91d3a1ec036f3bbcaafde83e6855a1bf1a62d31dac31a40a40d878f181; commit 1d76a01a) after this unit's runs. v3 is v2 except that
it tells apart same-named declarations of one file. Re-run on the same two populations and roots
(nice -n 10, one at a time):

- populations: no file repeats a screened short name (before: 260 screened, after: 267), so v3's
  output equals v2's by construction;
- measured: v3's output equals logs/screen-before.txt and logs/screen-after.txt byte for byte
  from the counts line on (the header lines name the script):
  before: v3 = v2 (from the counts line on)
  after: v3 = v2 (from the counts line on)
